  "project_description": "Seeds Editor is the editor layer of the Seeds distribution. On install it creates ready-made text formats and their bound editors: a 'Simple Editor' (CKEditor 5, restricted filter_html), an 'Advanced Editor' (ACE source-code editor), and an optional 'Basic Editor' (full CKEditor 5 with media embedding, Linkit, entity embed, media resize, styles and tables). It wires together roughly a dozen contrib editor modules so a site gets a known-good WYSIWYG setup from a single enable. A small settings form additionally lets an administrator point CKEditor at custom LTR and RTL stylesheets, loaded automatically per the current language direction.",
